    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i can't let go. if i let anyone back in, if i step outside this life, the pain comes back. it's all or nothing. it feels like the only way to actually be free from this weight—to actually stop the suffocating feeling—is to just stop everything. like, if the fortress is a tomb, then isn't the only way to truly leave just to... leave?",
